_publ_section_title
;\
Novel indapamide analogue: crystal structure and Hirshfeld surface analysis of
3-chloro-4-(<i>N</i>,<i>N</i>-diethynylsulfamoyl)-<i>N</i>-(2-methylindolin-\
1-yl)benzamide
;
_publ_section_title_footnote .
_publ_section_synopsis
;
The title molecule adopts a shallow cup-shaped conformation with the
chlorobenzamide portion as the bottom. In the crystal, helical chains along
the <i>a</i>-axis direction are formed by N---H...O hydrogen bonds reinforced
by C---H...\p(ring) and weak \p-stacking interactions. A Hirshfeld surface
analysis was performed.
;
